    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to find any motivation when the \"meaning\" everyone talks about feels like such a lie we tell ourselves to stay busy. like, we're just performing these little tasks to distract us from the void. it feels like there's no real reason to keep pushing through the struggle if the end result is always just... nothingness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
